      "content": "it's not that painful, just feels heavy and tight. i'm really trying to avoid the doctor if i can because i have to work all week and the co-pay is huge. do you think it's possible it's just inflammation from the walk? maybe i can just take some ibuprofen and keep it elevated for a few days?",
